# Phantom Interference with both modes ({U} + {3} + {1} = five mana, five Moxen, the pool empty after): on Bot2's turn 2 Bot1
# makes a 2/2 white flying Spirit and counters Bot2's Ornithopter unless Bot2 pays {2}; Bot2 has one Island and cannot.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Phantom Interference
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Ornithopter
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Phantom Interference.Cast
Bot1.Modes(Create a 2/2 white Spirit creature token with flying; Counter target spell unless its controller pays {2})
